## Chrome Web Store dashboard

The Chrome Web Store API only uploads and publishes; it can't edit the listing. Copy these fields
into the developer dashboard by hand.

### Store listing → Summary

From the manifest (`_locales/*/messages.json`, `extDescription`), so it ships with the package;
the dashboard shows it read-only. Limit: 132 characters.

{{summary}}

### Store listing → Description (Russian, primary language)

From `store/description.txt`. Pick **Russian** in the dashboard's language menu first.
Limit: 16,000 characters.

{{description}}

### Store listing → Description (English)

From `store/description.en.txt`. Switch the dashboard's language menu to **English**. Limit: 16,000
characters.

{{description_en}}

